# Docs and landing deploy with `vercel deploy` from the repo root (Root Directory
# is the repo root or apps/landing), so the CLI uploads the whole repo as `src/`.
# Each deployment counts toward Vercel deployment storage. Neither site builds
# from these paths.
#
# Every workspace keeps its package.json, plus patches/, pnpm-lock.yaml and
# pnpm-workspace.yaml: `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` validates the lockfile
# against all workspace importers. apps/extension stays whole because its
# postinstall (`wxt prepare`) needs the entrypoints.
/marketing
/spikes
/.worktrees
/.user-insights
/.feedback
/.agents
/.claude
/.specify
/.social
/.audit
/.oss-scanner
/assets
/docs
/release-notes
/tools
/apps/ios
/apps/cli/*
/apps/desktop/*
/apps/desktop-tauri/*
/apps/marketing-emails/*
/apps/sync-server/*
/packages/*/*
/tests/*/*
!/apps/*/package.json
!/packages/*/package.json
!/tests/*/package.json
/crates
